#: scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7163dab752be4e853ebd35c908daa199b78d9a2ebbb95f646523d07e787c7005
#. default-sha256: aac28a77d20856c47d8b0a0c255d216ab4465ba3dfa1ac5c4318733d5884395d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F1D91C51_4F99_4780_829C_DFD37ACB336A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The next day, I awoke with a "
"terrible fever."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫翌日――、⟪k:12⟫ひどい熱を出した。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1028ede680cffd07d042a535818d86f22820caf4b19cf5bbb9d9b9cc63cdafdb
#. default-sha256: 660af145b0dfe566038c06e5878a13813804e53e91a06ca9d816cf8ff42d6de0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5A90CE79_FF7B_4187_BAE0_20AF39FCD941"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I hovered in a sweltering wave of heat, unable to tell dream and reality apart, listening to "
"a seemingly endless stream of cracking noises."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫夢か現実か分からない灼熱のはざまで――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫亀裂の入る音を聞きつづけた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d8dbc7c5b4ece1fcf6cd45efe8347d57e95a88e28192f7f32a3ad3e90ac6787f
#. default-sha256: 4f83ae4eafb5b1e66be90a0bb6071904e3290dad7a86891acd55965ca62b9b0c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2358D0B0_F81B_49DC_98A5_0E40E057D26E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The sounds were coming from inside my body.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I thought I was falling apart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫どうやらそれは、⟪k:1⟫身体の内側から発せられるようで――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫きっと、⟪k:4⟫私が壊れていくの"
"だと思った。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f3ad9a0c2ef05829a7c2f68af75136315dab9404cb6a4c4ce6220eb5e363ed41
#. default-sha256: 8d6f8f1bec86e392bbf4951bca0c0433340b22cecbc47e628f09775faa772e0d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A6ABD87_065F_45B1_98C4_5C7CEDE5CDE5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother was horribly worried."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母はひどく心配した。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 93a8dc3849804f222acadc6fad78da0071eb9fccafc921a7416e4d3f7164ebbf
#. default-sha256: 74fd1c5490cfe327aa7236ed72d6da6debdbe87214a1e710915b9514c09d5249
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE7745A7_EBC2_4845_902B_6BB1BD2FE613"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I had never been the most healthy child, but I had never fallen this ill either."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私はもともと身体の強い方ではなかったが、⟪k:1⟫ここまで不調をきたすことは無かった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ad4f0d24ccb540625fa9e8a9a906e90cd0bc0d9be7ca44fa7a581beea61c083f
#. default-sha256: 219404a4a1a6c9ddd4569e4bf963f03cbca2b3b94fb3adb8482195cc883b93fc
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A50E480_AE92_4FBF_90B9_11ED809885BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t get out of bed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫My voice was raspy, like an old woman’s.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫I was "
"genuinely afraid I would wither away and die."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫起き上がることも出来ず、⟪k:1⟫声を発しても老人のようにしわがれて――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫自分でも、⟪k:4⟫私"
"はこのまま朽ちていくのではないかと思ったほどだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62cba201a88461c7756a2b5b7f2af509c0cf402293ab5254d2a6547232a598a7
#. default-sha256: 0c1fb4064321c508d37cc3150b2ad0abaa5c7f1084ea06b2ef4849cee3f2f0e2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9DFE4400_A100_4512_A293_640E884E0448"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Mother called in doctor after doctor to see me, but they all said it was the flu."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その後、⟪k:1⟫かわるがわる医者がやってきたが、⟪k:2⟫すべて風邪だと診断して帰っていった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5a7a5500434bb9fc7be36b3dd83dcf5df4c4abcbeed1d432b0a3db6a4979309f
#. default-sha256: 287ebdb846c47dd692b3ec5c027eb2ef5abf950a1a39985b5fd0efbdd58a4011
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9B0872F9_8B72_4CCD_BCA1_00968A4D19CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That bodily pain was common with a fever."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫高熱が出るときに、⟪k:1⟫身体が痛むのはよくあることだと言う。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f1739b1b1bd402df6579c5f4433dd226de7360c54051671b30fb284ef3db7127
#. default-sha256: 92d4b1fd285dfc61342522b77a0e5ebc33d8e8825c835e356e2d25080cab1a5b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B0834569_89A7_4A75_8EEB_ADC8174E35E9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫While there was a doctor in the house, Mother was able to remain relatively calm,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫医者がいる間、⟪k:1⟫母は落ち着きを取り戻すが――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9bcb39e1de91adf0d4f1dd50d4d34cfa36bffa46c784e491de7e3c0deaf2ac4c
#. default-sha256: e267aefe624536d70490be4bfe2d1a1f89393d9264b6b3d21ec9782078ab7a0b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5B8AFEEF_7744_4E0A_B95A_8D0ADFF881A3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but once they were gone, the anxiety came back. ⟪k:1⟫She stayed with me, day and night, even "
"foregoing sleep."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫誰もいなくなると、⟪k:1⟫不安定になって、⟪k:2⟫寝る間を惜しんで私の傍にいた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 35fe550ac7c8a19b62606ff3e99bf838a1a3e4912eeba1139a42d20177143095
#. default-sha256: 678811af68b906e5bd86eb274c09bc33c9edcd1e18a5bb0ab58e8ed74456bfc7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_930E5261_C89B_49F8_B299_A99BF37D8E3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her hands gripped mine. They held me fast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母の手が、⟪k:1⟫私の指を、⟪k:2⟫私の身体を包み込む。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cf620fb321b83e1447ee5aa64ec137c23c5ecd8d22b94222adfbe114307cb8e
#. default-sha256: eedba13ca108a1262d1239e374f5054e0f874f838fc73ba0be32d24a4fa20bf8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_CB48627A_80F4_499B_BD28_D389CCD92A26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She had her head bowed, as if in prayer."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫まるで神か天使に懇願するように、⟪k:1⟫彼女は俯いていた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a90158e32d060edb3ebcf4c19301758a4b0db2b65ddc3a084e51fef5a3415be
#. default-sha256: 24c339ab5bc15ee9b4ac9b060daadcf0cf7b744822e21e1c8876b59b0619d317
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_884467C2_57AC_43E9_BAD3_47857FA710BE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Don’t worry... ⟪k:1⟫It’ll be all right, Michelle.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫God is watching over you... ⟪k:4⟫"
"He will protect you..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫ミシェル……⟪k:1⟫ミシェル……⟪k:2⟫大丈夫よ。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫神様が……きっと見守ってくださるからね……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b84bf2b6c60988bfa44a918e4f8ebabc403768adde89e73f2743fdff7e0ffc36
#. default-sha256: 2d2c3b6a93c34a79c0a2973e9aaa3bab43642c62a80c19bedf03398bec182531
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DBA90755_DFD7_4EC8_A226_250D17981B38"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You are His child...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You are His angel sent to Earth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫だってあなたは、⟪k:1⟫神様の子なんですもの……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫天使の生まれ変わりなのよ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7f4e6df473c66a4cba3434de785fe6f42336bf2ca91227787e83507ee6531a7
#. default-sha256: 96327c9a312f116030e5c28d9ecbde35e0df80eec6b8b80901ea49fdd78e6343
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F151E5BB_71B9_4D70_B606_94E38C173BAA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫He will not forsake you...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The doctors say it’s just the flu..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫見はなすわけがない……。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫お医者様も、⟪k:3⟫ただの風邪だとみんな言うわ……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f0bfad805b6475083e305f5a1bd7755c6c1f24c524de0e28ce9c803f91bf7c6
#. default-sha256: e510130b22604ac556b91edf4e0378cc17ebf87149a958e49d3964b79680d569
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_8F36946A_C49E_475F_9514_0BD7E7BC2449"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though her words seemed to be directed at me, there was a vacantness in her voice, as if "
"they were really for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫母は、⟪k:1⟫私に語りかけているようで、⟪k:2⟫どこかうつろだった。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫自分自身に言い聞かせ"
"るために、⟪k:5⟫呟き続けている。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ff4cbf14a7e3fc0e07af5275a2a3dd72f44b7e1bcc1c1682bdee44db0752d8de
#. default-sha256: fe2485421b9da5ee4d9168702386fbc4b8660c82355471b5ab10ab676acc816e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3E6EACDC_4063_44A7_A907_1D8A41C134C3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For so long, she had wanted a daughter."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は本当に娘が欲しかったのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99cc35955face6d97937bfce30d9db5ea903c0434f9fa64ddc69f2db51c09321
#. default-sha256: a465244dc5e6cbb7fe56dcd83e838cfa80b4f4d68fe2caa90a6a223532d40d97
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AE779766_B600_44A3_826C_F89A5EA9FB46"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t understand her fixation,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうしてそこまで執着するのか分からなかったが――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53f20d78719d1c9b9c29da98b9aacd03a95a6d8c8d47f68b2ff0937f18232b84
#. default-sha256: 90828fb1bd5cbb9c156065303ecbb29ef85b5ac8f7dc093f81acd1517be0f437
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D55C7EBE_B4DE_40DE_A881_F0DC1A124062"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but seeing her there through my cloudy eyes, I wanted to apologize for ever thinking "
"spending time with her was agonizing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫朦朧とする視界のなか、⟪k:1⟫その姿を見て、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫ともに過ごすのが苦痛だと思ったことを、"
"⟪k:4⟫詫びたくなった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fefa92e4e90a1e7c294f7f1927f7f28a96fcb5cf07b06c6de826777731f3c5b8
#. default-sha256: 4387a34c75a531832a0280d11030c2c5000e1fd03bf3ab2e173724593c175361
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E8A1882A_69ED_4483_985D_36EC44A05515"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How are you feeling?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Your mother’s here for you. Don’t worry."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫苦しいの……？⟪k:1⟫　お母様はここにいますよ、⟪k:2⟫安心して……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15116275efb11158c9902c8b0691354a41371c951d44158b1c1d2d15dc4d73da
#. default-sha256: 054cb5a01d442c87e0f73c2b8a4a15145cdc190a50ac66be606ad8eb274194a1
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4BFC0A0A_CF7B_43E8_AFE0_C0BD252C0900"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But the only sound that came from my mouth was a faint gasp."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫けれど、⟪k:1⟫私の声は音にならなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 54a58ca0c312d5b3f2c74572a71d712fefe5578cc404ede27e2b368d3f88509c
#. default-sha256: 3e928937e628406e56016a52c33d3c8266be572122116fd438681c54a151409e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABF6BBD6_A164_4D4A_9737_D1FF16AD80E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I drifted in and out of sleep, Mother’s hand wrapped around my own."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫母の指先を感じながら、⟪k:1⟫私は幾度目かの眠りについた。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cbc5ae572e2526dd83908abf0b6804d05bbd0d2e96174d98b65303e4e8e1a8c5
#. default-sha256: d4c95aa2f1c8b4a23ff680ca0dfb3e0e8c58696e28647518f1d602dd3e3a869c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BE583775_9281_49FD_AD87_8E850FF4C7F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I had numerous dreams."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そして幾度も夢を見た。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 69446026f8a52ea3153e5dd28792d4054212a6bb1c2e000eec68dad62c783ddd
#. default-sha256: 32fe4f8b091fa0cd560fb28954f1111c7aff9be99483499751fcd87ecdd43364
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A98538DF_E530_42E4_857B_6E0DB5206773"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was a man."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫夢の中で、⟪k:3⟫私は男だった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2bb03b8c58215d15d985f9d627d07882c8fd8826498784d92bf006ead26982e
#. default-sha256: b47e1a4c0c44b230152a387af98c216e3b4fba9238649e40038d63cf6be50a56
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_17B971C9_54DD_4ECA_879A_10A0738677A7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I was Didier and I was Georges."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫夢の中で、⟪k:3⟫私はディディエであり、⟪k:4⟫ジョルジュであった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 965ac4fadb077752a94787879e75fe3f02a2699548b2eb08557da002fab9ed86
#. default-sha256: b7d1904beb9651cc62bad7b360eadc041aeb66de90c47673966e73a22a83e541
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_56939500_E8C9_47AA_ADD1_22312681BFA3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫In my dreams, I fell in love with Aimee,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫夢の中で、⟪k:3⟫私はエメに再び恋をして――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bfc072106cb5b91b5028e405a78193fe80599c01cd72b503bd61ed1f3bdfb4f0
#. default-sha256: 910adb74ea7982bc87d0dd423dab1421424750ba8fbde8ea1d83dc75af7d566b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3D45B051_380A_4FD6_96A7_200F6F0BFD4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and in my dreams, I loved her."
