"⟪k:0⟫A look of restrained fear on her face, Mother stepped toward me, placing her hand on my "
"forehead. ⟪k:1⟫Her palm felt hot against my skin."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫母は怯えながら私に近づき、⟪k:1⟫私の額に触れたが――⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫彼女の手のひらの方が、⟪k:4⟫熱を帯"
"びていた。"

