msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BF92EEC8_A75F_41EE_A68E_28898B4C2636"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Again, something felt wrong about her calling it a sickness, but I had no evidence to the "
"contrary."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫“病気”……その言葉に違和感を覚えていたものの、⟪k:1⟫反論するだけの材料が私にはなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BF92EEC8_A75F_41EE_A68E_48898B4C2636
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb03d70cdd0863e36d154cd80651e54ae9be5f97ba8928994221ea908660c0de
#. default-sha256: 4f5934c46d278c3cd60c55b5cfb539587d613168b85b9ffbedb9b19aeb65bdd5
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BF92EEC8_A75F_41EE_A68E_48898B4C2636"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I had no way to know I ⟪k:1⟫wouldn’t⟪k:2⟫ get others sick if I exposed them, as she claimed, "
"so I had no choice but to do as she said."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫「周りに移るようなものだったらいけないから」と言われてしまうと、⟪k:1⟫その時の私には、⟪k:2⟫従"
"わざるを得なかったのだ。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_0F40A075_BAA4_46CF_9219_8BBBB0EDEAA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 186c2022d275277bb2193e7eb01b355b9c14b3522c667ff673b6602826c7e734
#. default-sha256: f2b47ba14131cce7856b30ac682bfd4370c109786a1e3511c059c61a8c45fb72
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_0F40A075_BAA4_46CF_9219_8BBBB0EDEAA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In time, Mother too stopped visiting me, and the only people I saw were servants."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫やがて母すら部屋に来なくなり――世話の者だけが訪れるようになる。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A0E2A4C_FD68_4B9C_B559_3574398C9C6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e0161337a2a55b24a1bb5eefdd491eabe118c1f92da5d6e6d5811c6a4f1a60ba
