msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A0E2A4C_FD68_4B9C_B559_3574398C9C6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They did their jobs, but refused to look me in the eye."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その人は私に目を合わせようとしなかった。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_7A0E2A4C_FD68_4B9C_B559_3579398C9C6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 29b88d655fee937363daa08ff108acd3498ba841b72a8163303dbed97c314bb8
#. default-sha256: 4bba8b829fa03949655d8f1fc355a3b904003c405028d307114cf14ea4d44ebf
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_7A0E2A4C_FD68_4B9C_B559_3579398C9C6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫No one else came to see me, though.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Not Aimee, Didier, or Georges..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫世話の者以外は誰ひとりとして見舞いに来ない。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫エメは勿論、⟪k:3⟫ディディエも、⟪k:4⟫"
"ジョルジュも……。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A47B419A_98E7_4F4E_955E_EB77A7A28630
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd54b7262415a934ef13d67e5c3cb8c2cd86c82915e5c6d19506cacb22c97576
#. default-sha256: 678d7503318730368187983312984ef78f95581cc550bd8532e6c862b3496583
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A47B419A_98E7_4F4E_955E_EB77A7A28630"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫One month passed, then two, then three."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫そんな生活が一か月、⟪k:1⟫二か月、⟪k:2⟫三か月と続き――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_639C439F_7FBD_4174_9335_18B330CEF9E6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9678bf357ec519602dd56f10f8b14b0e251d0a71410bef858cf38b662e2b25ff
#. default-sha256: 483d6a9fe9d947fa6cf5048702b7dc7a543359bc85c3cd702fcfb00d41bdb48c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_639C439F_7FBD_4174_9335_18B330CEF9E6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Occasionally, the pain in my joints would withdraw. At other times, it would worsen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫私を蝕む関節の痛みは、⟪k:1⟫時に和らぎ、⟪k:2⟫時に強くなる。"

#: scenario7:scenario7_8EE36FF4_3BBA_47F2_98F5_3049A87697ED
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60b6a087423d3eb1f365345f12b249a8ff06b562fac5a4f02f4401821d347492
